  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Shaken, blackvenom dregs take a whole night to settle back to the bottom.</p><p><em>&amp;Reference[ingestedpoison] Poison</em></p><p>A creature that swallows this poison, for example in food or drink, must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=17 format=long]] or have the &amp;Reference[Poisoned apply=false] and &amp;Reference[Unconscious apply=false] conditions for 8 hours. On a failed save it also takes [[/damage 6d6 type=poison]] damage, or half as much on a successful one. The effect ends early on the creature if it takes damage or if someone within 5 feet of it takes an action to shake it awake.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
